s instead of body)\n\nOther:\n- Adds the ability to override `start` method of `ConnectorBase`","tree":{"sha":"cac472a0a7a2370e938f8dc1a8414b940ebf9ab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hummingbot/hummingbot/git/trees/cac472a0a7a2370e938f8dc1a8414b940ebf9ab9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hummingbot/hummingbot/git/commits/d24508e67dce1f776a1d7469fcbd6e48d4a1572a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hummingbot/hummingbot/commits/d24508e67dce1f776a1d7469fcbd6e48d4a1572a","html_url":"https://github.com/hummingbot/hummingbot/commit/d24508e67dce1f776a1d7469fcbd6e48d4a1572a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hummingbot/hummingbot/commits/d24508e67dce1f776a1d7469fcbd6e48d4a1572a/comments","author":{"login":"petioptrv","id":15842646,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQyNjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15842646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv","html_url":"https://github.com/petioptrv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptrv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"petioptrv","id":15842646,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQyNjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15842646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petioptr